  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, you can expend one use of your Channel Divinity to present your Holy Symbol and make a sphere of twilight emanate from you. The sphere is centered on you, has a 30-foot radius, is filled with Dim Light, and moves with you. It lasts for 1 minute or until you have the Incapacitated condition or die. Whenever a creature (including you) ends its turn in the sphere, you can grant it one of these benefits.</p><ul><li>It gains Temporary Hit Points equal to 1d6 plus your Cleric level.</li><li>You end one effect on it causing the Charmed or Frightened condition.</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
